{"overview":"داستان کلر رندال، یک پرستار جنگی متاهل از سال ۱۹۴۵ که به طرز مرموزی به سال ۱۷۴۳ سفر می‌کند، جایی که او بلافاصله به دنیایی ناشناخته پرتاب می‌شود که زندگی‌اش در معرض تهدید قرار دارد. وقتی او مجبور به ازدواج با جیمی، یک جنگجوی جوان اسکاتلندی جوانمرد و رمانتیک می‌شود، رابطه‌ای پرشور بین دو مرد کاملاً متفاوت در دو زندگی ناسازگار آغاز می‌شود که قلب کلر را پاره می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The story of Claire Randall, a married combat nurse from 1945 who is mysteriously swept back in time to 1743, where she is immediately thrown into an unknown world where her life is threatened. When she is forced to marry Jamie, a chivalrous and romantic young Scottish warrior, a passionate affair is ignited that tears Claire's heart between two vastly different men in two irreconcilable lives.","tagline_en":"What if your future was the past?","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":86,"y":2014,"poster":"/8aORMKeyjt6HLli1INK4zjLmsxh.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":16,"y":2014,"poster":"/sY1LNJNnuiJf1gKycdf8PbONadv.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":13,"y":2016,"poster":"/qkq78mSY5pjpAWqJFaBBXcfVzGx.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":13,"y":2017,"poster":"/pCTSO32nTmJHkEFAv3qJLhVueEa.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":13,"y":2018,"poster":"/6EvUPkNIOrIH22yCYn5FNyupfDn.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":12,"y":2020,"poster":"/wAOATDDQ4ECeSYS779BLRNMQoBp.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":8,"y":2022,"poster":"/oR0PM7hFDqY3kO12cLLQMKiJt8I.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":16,"y":2023,"poster":"/oftZNfyTVNU7IfOqoGLoT8MGvNs.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":10,"y":2026,"poster":"/t4oRB2iCGh0Db2OmZfrTPPx8q0x.jpg"}],"episodes":101,"crew":["رونالد مور"],"crew_en":["Ronald D. Moore"],"countries":["GB","US"],"cast":[{"name":"کترینا بلف","role":"Claire Randall Fraser","photo":"/lerCNTjO6FQIam2lF5SXHA4dY7H.jpg","en":"Caitríona Balfe"},{"name":"Sam Heughan","role":"Jamie Fraser","photo":"/toBZ2mxZ2AbYYBfFV3Xvwm2QR4I.jpg"},{"name":"Sophie Skelton","role":"Brian